: pregenerated
:
: Test that the pregenerated database support code is up to date. The
: development build records the checksum of the persistent classes header
: it is produced from (see buildfile). So this test fails if the header was
: changed without a development build.
:
sha256sum --sum-only $src_base/model.hxx >>>$src_base/pregenerated/libobe/model.hxx.sha256
